[[:db/add "e5ad053a-2c47-534c-a638-c5ed9e190adb" :answer/id #uuid "e5ad053a-2c47-534c-a638-c5ed9e190adb"] [:db/add "e5ad053a-2c47-534c-a638-c5ed9e190adb" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "e5ad053a-2c47-534c-a638-c5ed9e190adb" :answer/value "\\langle 4,1,-2\\rangle"] [:db/ensure "e5ad053a-2c47-534c-a638-c5ed9e190adb" :answer/validate] [:db/add "f46a550a-bb88-5ff9-816a-7fec21a2d4b9" :answer/id #uuid "f46a550a-bb88-5ff9-816a-7fec21a2d4b9"] [:db/add "f46a550a-bb88-5ff9-816a-7fec21a2d4b9" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "f46a550a-bb88-5ff9-816a-7fec21a2d4b9" :answer/value "\\langle -4,-1,0\\rangle"] [:db/ensure "f46a550a-bb88-5ff9-816a-7fec21a2d4b9" :answer/validate] [:db/add "8e585507-ed73-581d-82af-1de96b6a84b0" :answer/id #uuid "8e585507-ed73-581d-82af-1de96b6a84b0"] [:db/add "8e585507-ed73-581d-82af-1de96b6a84b0" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "8e585507-ed73-581d-82af-1de96b6a84b0" :answer/value "\\langle -12,-3,2\\rangle"] [:db/ensure "8e585507-ed73-581d-82af-1de96b6a84b0" :answer/validate] [:db/add "576b49ef-08d6-509a-a339-7db9696407f1" :answer/id #uuid "576b49ef-08d6-509a-a339-7db9696407f1"] [:db/add "576b49ef-08d6-509a-a339-7db9696407f1" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "576b49ef-08d6-509a-a339-7db9696407f1" :answer/value "\\langle -20,-5,4\\rangle"] [:db/ensure "576b49ef-08d6-509a-a339-7db9696407f1" :answer/validate] [:db/add "2cc81c2d-5cf5-5ebc-82a5-0ca18d1d236f" :answer/id #uuid "2cc81c2d-5cf5-5ebc-82a5-0ca18d1d236f"] [:db/add "2cc81c2d-5cf5-5ebc-82a5-0ca18d1d236f" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "2cc81c2d-5cf5-5ebc-82a5-0ca18d1d236f" :answer/value "\\langle 0,0,-1\\rangle"] [:db/ensure "2cc81c2d-5cf5-5ebc-82a5-0ca18d1d236f" :answer/validate] [:db/add "8be728cb-f0c2-5257-bbe1-2b6c444bfe5f" :answer-field/id #uuid "8be728cb-f0c2-5257-bbe1-2b6c444bfe5f"] [:db/add "8be728cb-f0c2-5257-bbe1-2b6c444bfe5f" :answer-field/key "selection"] [:db/add "8be728cb-f0c2-5257-bbe1-2b6c444bfe5f" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add "8be728cb-f0c2-5257-bbe1-2b6c444bfe5f" :answer-field/choices "e5ad053a-2c47-534c-a638-c5ed9e190adb"] [:db/add "8be728cb-f0c2-5257-bbe1-2b6c444bfe5f" :answer-field/choices "f46a550a-bb88-5ff9-816a-7fec21a2d4b9"] [:db/add "8be728cb-f0c2-5257-bbe1-2b6c444bfe5f" :answer-field/choices "8e585507-ed73-581d-82af-1de96b6a84b0"] [:db/add "8be728cb-f0c2-5257-bbe1-2b6c444bfe5f" :answer-field/choices "576b49ef-08d6-509a-a339-7db9696407f1"] [:db/add "8be728cb-f0c2-5257-bbe1-2b6c444bfe5f" :answer-field/choices "2cc81c2d-5cf5-5ebc-82a5-0ca18d1d236f"] [:db/add "8be728cb-f0c2-5257-bbe1-2b6c444bfe5f" :answer-field/correct "2cc81c2d-5cf5-5ebc-82a5-0ca18d1d236f"] [:db/ensure "8be728cb-f0c2-5257-bbe1-2b6c444bfe5f" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "df38aa87-1012-5fca-b7e8-8bc10cbe5b07" :question/id #uuid "df38aa87-1012-5fca-b7e8-8bc10cbe5b07"] [:db/add "df38aa87-1012-5fca-b7e8-8bc10cbe5b07" :question/problem "Consider the system of linear equations\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}2x-4y+4z&=-4 \\\\ -2x+7y-z&=1 \\\\ 2x-5y+z&=-1\\end{aligned}\\right..\n$$\n\nUse the standard method of Gaussian elimination to reduce the augmented matrix $M$ of the system to row echelon form, and then solve the linear system."] [:db/add "df38aa87-1012-5fca-b7e8-8bc10cbe5b07" :question/worked-solution "The augmented matrix is\n\n$$\nM=\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}2 & -4 & 4 & -4 \\\\ -2 & 7 & -1 & 1 \\\\ 2 & -5 & 1 & -1\\end{array}\\right].\n$$\n\nUsing $R_1:=\\frac{1}{2}R_1$, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -2 & 2 & -2 \\\\ -2 & 7 & -1 & 1 \\\\ 2 & -5 & 1 & -1\\end{array}\\right].\n$$\n\nUsing $R_2:=R_2+2R_1$, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -2 & 2 & -2 \\\\ 0 & 3 & 3 & -3 \\\\ 2 & -5 & 1 & -1\\end{array}\\right].\n$$\n\nUsing $R_3:=R_3-2R_1$, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -2 & 2 & -2 \\\\ 0 & 3 & 3 & -3 \\\\ 0 & -1 & -3 & 3\\end{array}\\right].\n$$\n\nUsing $R_2:=\\frac{1}{3}R_2$, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -2 & 2 & -2 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 1 & -1 \\\\ 0 & -1 & -3 & 3\\end{array}\\right].\n$$\n\nUsing $R_3:=R_3+R_2$, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -2 & 2 & -2 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 1 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -2 & 2\\end{array}\\right].\n$$\n\nUsing $R_3:=-\\frac{1}{2}R_3$, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -2 & 2 & -2 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 1 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & -1\\end{array}\\right].\n$$\n\nThe matrix is in row echelon form: each pivot lies to the right of the pivot above it, with zeros below each pivot.\n\nThe corresponding triangular system is\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x-2y+2z&=-2 \\\\ y+z&=-1 \\\\ z&=-1\\end{aligned}\\right..\n$$\n\nBack substitution gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}z&=-1 \\\\ y&=-1-(1)(-1)=0 \\\\ x&=-2-(-2)(0)-(2)(-1)=0.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solution is $\\langle 0,0,-1\\rangle$."] [:db/add "df38aa87-1012-5fca-b7e8-8bc10cbe5b07" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "df38aa87-1012-5fca-b7e8-8bc10cbe5b07" :question/answer-fields "8be728cb-f0c2-5257-bbe1-2b6c444bfe5f"] [:db/ensure "df38aa87-1012-5fca-b7e8-8bc10cbe5b07" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186096672 :knowledge-point/questions "df38aa87-1012-5fca-b7e8-8bc10cbe5b07"] [:db/add "fdf39191-6d95-59a4-9ac9-207756b848a4" :answer/id #uuid "fdf39191-6d95-59a4-9ac9-207756b848a4"] [:db/add "fdf39191-6d95-59a4-9ac9-207756b848a4" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "fdf39191-6d95-59a4-9ac9-207756b848a4" :answer/value "\\langle -10,1,2\\rangle"] [:db/ensure "fdf39191-6d95-59a4-9ac9-207756b848a4" :answer/validate] [:db/add "eb8bd090-87d6-5c0c-a321-8b01a8e93809" :answer/id #uuid "eb8bd090-87d6-5c0c-a321-8b01a8e93809"] [:db/add "eb8bd090-87d6-5c0c-a321-8b01a8e93809" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "eb8bd090-87d6-5c0c-a321-8b01a8e93809" :answer/value "\\langle -2,-3,2\\rangle"] [:db/ensure "eb8bd090-87d6-5c0c-a321-8b01a8e93809" :answer/validate] [:db/add "eed88a33-f33d-50f0-9af4-609fbf1baeab" :answer/id #uuid "eed88a33-f33d-50f0-9af4-609fbf1baeab"] [:db/add "eed88a33-f33d-50f0-9af4-609fbf1baeab" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "eed88a33-f33d-50f0-9af4-609fbf1baeab" :answer/value "\\langle -8,0,2\\rangle"] [:db/ensure "eed88a33-f33d-50f0-9af4-609fbf1baeab" :answer/validate] [:db/add "68754ced-0db5-537f-8166-2de609b4c84e" :answer/id #uuid "68754ced-0db5-537f-8166-2de609b4c84e"] [:db/add "68754ced-0db5-537f-8166-2de609b4c84e" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "68754ced-0db5-537f-8166-2de609b4c84e" :answer/value "\\langle -2,2,-3\\rangle"] [:db/ensure "68754ced-0db5-537f-8166-2de609b4c84e" :answer/validate] [:db/add "5e81b2ae-7b06-5bae-85fd-7a11cd6e16f4" :answer/id #uuid "5e81b2ae-7b06-5bae-85fd-7a11cd6e16f4"] [:db/add "5e81b2ae-7b06-5bae-85fd-7a11cd6e16f4" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "5e81b2ae-7b06-5bae-85fd-7a11cd6e16f4" :answer/value "\\langle 0,0,-2\\rangle"] [:db/ensure "5e81b2ae-7b06-5bae-85fd-7a11cd6e16f4" :answer/validate] [:db/add "05002b8c-5ca1-5ef0-b09a-1fb3703d253b" :answer-field/id #uuid "05002b8c-5ca1-5ef0-b09a-1fb3703d253b"] [:db/add "05002b8c-5ca1-5ef0-b09a-1fb3703d253b" :answer-field/key "selection"] [:db/add "05002b8c-5ca1-5ef0-b09a-1fb3703d253b" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add "05002b8c-5ca1-5ef0-b09a-1fb3703d253b" :answer-field/choices "fdf39191-6d95-59a4-9ac9-207756b848a4"] [:db/add "05002b8c-5ca1-5ef0-b09a-1fb3703d253b" :answer-field/choices "eb8bd090-87d6-5c0c-a321-8b01a8e93809"] [:db/add "05002b8c-5ca1-5ef0-b09a-1fb3703d253b" :answer-field/choices "eed88a33-f33d-50f0-9af4-609fbf1baeab"] [:db/add "05002b8c-5ca1-5ef0-b09a-1fb3703d253b" :answer-field/choices "68754ced-0db5-537f-8166-2de609b4c84e"] [:db/add "05002b8c-5ca1-5ef0-b09a-1fb3703d253b" :answer-field/choices "5e81b2ae-7b06-5bae-85fd-7a11cd6e16f4"] [:db/add "05002b8c-5ca1-5ef0-b09a-1fb3703d253b" :answer-field/correct "eb8bd090-87d6-5c0c-a321-8b01a8e93809"] [:db/ensure "05002b8c-5ca1-5ef0-b09a-1fb3703d253b" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "b3a8e3f4-a642-5a95-aa9d-78680655fca3" :question/id #uuid "b3a8e3f4-a642-5a95-aa9d-78680655fca3"] [:db/add "b3a8e3f4-a642-5a95-aa9d-78680655fca3" :question/problem "Consider the augmented matrix\n\n$$\nM=\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}-3 & -6 & -6 & 12 \\\\ -2 & -2 & 0 & 10 \\\\ -1 & 0 & 0 & 2\\end{array}\\right].\n$$\n\nUse the standard method of Gaussian elimination to reduce the augmented matrix $M$ of the system to row echelon form, and then solve the linear system."] [:db/add "b3a8e3f4-a642-5a95-aa9d-78680655fca3" :question/worked-solution "The augmented matrix is\n\n$$\nM=\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}-3 & -6 & -6 & 12 \\\\ -2 & -2 & 0 & 10 \\\\ -1 & 0 & 0 & 2\\end{array}\\right].\n$$\n\nUsing $R_1:=-\\frac{1}{3}R_1$, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 2 & 2 & -4 \\\\ -2 & -2 & 0 & 10 \\\\ -1 & 0 & 0 & 2\\end{array}\\right].\n$$\n\nUsing $R_2:=R_2+2R_1$, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 2 & 2 & -4 \\\\ 0 & 2 & 4 & 2 \\\\ -1 & 0 & 0 & 2\\end{array}\\right].\n$$\n\nUsing $R_3:=R_3+R_1$, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 2 & 2 & -4 \\\\ 0 & 2 & 4 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 2 & 2 & -2\\end{array}\\right].\n$$\n\nUsing $R_2:=\\frac{1}{2}R_2$, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 2 & 2 & -4 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 2 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 2 & 2 & -2\\end{array}\\right].\n$$\n\nUsing $R_3:=R_3-2R_2$, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 2 & 2 & -4 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 2 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -2 & -4\\end{array}\\right].\n$$\n\nUsing $R_3:=-\\frac{1}{2}R_3$, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 2 & 2 & -4 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 2 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & 2\\end{array}\\right].\n$$\n\nThe matrix is in row echelon form: each pivot lies to the right of the pivot above it, with zeros below each pivot.\n\nThe corresponding triangular system is\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x+2y+2z&=-4 \\\\ y+2z&=1 \\\\ z&=2\\end{aligned}\\right..\n$$\n\nBack substitution gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}z&=2 \\\\ y&=1-(2)(2)=-3 \\\\ x&=-4-(2)(-3)-(2)(2)=-2.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solution is $\\langle -2,-3,2\\rangle$."] [:db/add "b3a8e3f4-a642-5a95-aa9d-78680655fca3" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "b3a8e3f4-a642-5a95-aa9d-78680655fca3" :question/answer-fields "05002b8c-5ca1-5ef0-b09a-1fb3703d253b"] [:db/ensure "b3a8e3f4-a642-5a95-aa9d-78680655fca3" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186096672 :knowledge-point/questions "b3a8e3f4-a642-5a95-aa9d-78680655fca3"] [:db/add "74a17679-a0fd-5d20-a813-acc4084edb59" :answer/id #uuid "74a17679-a0fd-5d20-a813-acc4084edb59"] [:db/add "74a17679-a0fd-5d20-a813-acc4084edb59" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "74a17679-a0fd-5d20-a813-acc4084edb59" :answer/value "x=-2,\\quad y=3,\\quad z=-2"] [:db/ensure "74a17679-a0fd-5d20-a813-acc4084edb59" :answer/validate] [:db/add "64526bc1-0796-50c4-b7ff-cbfa7c0f81a2" :answer/id #uuid "64526bc1-0796-50c4-b7ff-cbfa7c0f81a2"] [:db/add "64526bc1-0796-50c4-b7ff-cbfa7c0f81a2" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "64526bc1-0796-50c4-b7ff-cbfa7c0f81a2" :answer/value "x=2,\\quad y=1,\\quad z=-3"] [:db/ensure "64526bc1-0796-50c4-b7ff-cbfa7c0f81a2" :answer/validate] [:db/add "58f539d7-bad5-5450-b323-f58cfc237d62" :answer/id #uuid "58f539d7-bad5-5450-b323-f58cfc237d62"] [:db/add "58f539d7-bad5-5450-b323-f58cfc237d62" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "58f539d7-bad5-5450-b323-f58cfc237d62" :answer/value "x=-5,\\quad y=-2,\\quad z=2"] [:db/ensure "58f539d7-bad5-5450-b323-f58cfc237d62" :answer/validate] [:db/add "80c4630b-3da8-58ce-b397-84a010f40b41" :answer/id #uuid "80c4630b-3da8-58ce-b397-84a010f40b41"] [:db/add "80c4630b-3da8-58ce-b397-84a010f40b41" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "80c4630b-3da8-58ce-b397-84a010f40b41" :answer/value "x=-4,\\quad y=-3,\\quad z=2"] [:db/ensure "80c4630b-3da8-58ce-b397-84a010f40b41" :answer/validate] [:db/add "f2622e31-116a-53cb-8304-36562c55c7e3" :answer/id #uuid "f2622e31-116a-53cb-8304-36562c55c7e3"] [:db/add "f2622e31-116a-53cb-8304-36562c55c7e3" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "f2622e31-116a-53cb-8304-36562c55c7e3" :answer/value "x=-4,\\quad y=1,\\quad z=0"] [:db/ensure "f2622e31-116a-53cb-8304-36562c55c7e3" :answer/validate] [:db/add "c80227c3-ef07-510f-9f71-cca8594d8633" :answer-field/id #uuid "c80227c3-ef07-510f-9f71-cca8594d8633"] [:db/add "c80227c3-ef07-510f-9f71-cca8594d8633" :answer-field/key "selection"] [:db/add "c80227c3-ef07-510f-9f71-cca8594d8633" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add "c80227c3-ef07-510f-9f71-cca8594d8633" :answer-field/choices "74a17679-a0fd-5d20-a813-acc4084edb59"] [:db/add "c80227c3-ef07-510f-9f71-cca8594d8633" :answer-field/choices "64526bc1-0796-50c4-b7ff-cbfa7c0f81a2"] [:db/add "c80227c3-ef07-510f-9f71-cca8594d8633" :answer-field/choices "58f539d7-bad5-5450-b323-f58cfc237d62"] [:db/add "c80227c3-ef07-510f-9f71-cca8594d8633" :answer-field/choices "80c4630b-3da8-58ce-b397-84a010f40b41"] [:db/add "c80227c3-ef07-510f-9f71-cca8594d8633" :answer-field/choices "f2622e31-116a-53cb-8304-36562c55c7e3"] [:db/add "c80227c3-ef07-510f-9f71-cca8594d8633" :answer-field/correct "74a17679-a0fd-5d20-a813-acc4084edb59"] [:db/ensure "c80227c3-ef07-510f-9f71-cca8594d8633" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "6873a277-f0d2-5415-8c86-31c0c7eb85d9" :question/id #uuid "6873a277-f0d2-5415-8c86-31c0c7eb85d9"] [:db/add "6873a277-f0d2-5415-8c86-31c0c7eb85d9" :question/problem "Consider the augmented matrix\n\n$$\nM=\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}-3 & -3 & -6 & 9 \\\\ 1 & 3 & 6 & -5 \\\\ -2 & -4 & -11 & 14\\end{array}\\right].\n$$\n\nUse the standard method of Gaussian elimination to reduce the augmented matrix $M$ of the system to row echelon form, and then solve the linear system."] [:db/add "6873a277-f0d2-5415-8c86-31c0c7eb85d9" :question/worked-solution "The augmented matrix is\n\n$$\nM=\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}-3 & -3 & -6 & 9 \\\\ 1 & 3 & 6 & -5 \\\\ -2 & -4 & -11 & 14\\end{array}\\right].\n$$\n\nUsing $R_1:=-\\frac{1}{3}R_1$, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 1 & 2 & -3 \\\\ 1 & 3 & 6 & -5 \\\\ -2 & -4 & -11 & 14\\end{array}\\right].\n$$\n\nUsing $R_2:=R_2-R_1$, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 1 & 2 & -3 \\\\ 0 & 2 & 4 & -2 \\\\ -2 & -4 & -11 & 14\\end{array}\\right].\n$$\n\nUsing $R_3:=R_3+2R_1$, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 1 & 2 & -3 \\\\ 0 & 2 & 4 & -2 \\\\ 0 & -2 & -7 & 8\\end{array}\\right].\n$$\n\nUsing $R_2:=\\frac{1}{2}R_2$, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 1 & 2 & -3 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 2 & -1 \\\\ 0 & -2 & -7 & 8\\end{array}\\right].\n$$\n\nUsing $R_3:=R_3+2R_2$, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 1 & 2 & -3 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 2 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -3 & 6\\end{array}\\right].\n$$\n\nUsing $R_3:=-\\frac{1}{3}R_3$, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 1 & 2 & -3 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 2 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & -2\\end{array}\\right].\n$$\n\nThe matrix is in row echelon form: each pivot lies to the right of the pivot above it, with zeros below each pivot.\n\nThe corresponding triangular system is\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x+y+2z&=-3 \\\\ y+2z&=-1 \\\\ z&=-2\\end{aligned}\\right..\n$$\n\nBack substitution gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}z&=-2 \\\\ y&=-1-(2)(-2)=3 \\\\ x&=-3-(1)(3)-(2)(-2)=-2.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solution is $\\langle -2,3,-2\\rangle$."] [:db/add "6873a277-f0d2-5415-8c86-31c0c7eb85d9" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "6873a277-f0d2-5415-8c86-31c0c7eb85d9" :question/answer-fields "c80227c3-ef07-510f-9f71-cca8594d8633"] [:db/ensure "6873a277-f0d2-5415-8c86-31c0c7eb85d9" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186096672 :knowledge-point/questions "6873a277-f0d2-5415-8c86-31c0c7eb85d9"] [:db/add "1ba3caa4-c9f4-52c4-a704-3b342ca7e518" :answer/id #uuid "1ba3caa4-c9f4-52c4-a704-3b342ca7e518"] [:db/add "1ba3caa4-c9f4-52c4-a704-3b342ca7e518" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "1ba3caa4-c9f4-52c4-a704-3b342ca7e518" :answer/value "x=7,\\quad y=3,\\quad z=0"] [:db/ensure "1ba3caa4-c9f4-52c4-a704-3b342ca7e518" :answer/validate] [:db/add "97f6aff9-412a-568d-8dfc-43da710852fd" :answer/id #uuid "97f6aff9-412a-568d-8dfc-43d